%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 320 200
%%Title: Tropical island
% Status: draft
% fractal_clouds#40: the /Tropical preset on a volcanic island. From the
% palm slope above its eastern shore, the beach curving away, the lagoon
% inside the fringing reef, surf breaking on the reef, and a second island
% across the strait under trade-wind cumulus.
%   -D Plan=true  the map from above, the camera marked
% Framing: DPI=36 scripts/render.sh gallery/tropical_island.ps
% Preview (gallery/previews/tropical_island-640x400.png), three bands, one core each:
%   DPI=144 scripts/render_bands.sh gallery/tropical_island.ps 0.475 0.6325 -- -D ErN=512 -D ErDrops=80000
%   bands 856 s, 705 s, 719 s (Apple silicon, Mac, bake cache on; #118)

/Plan where { pop } { /Plan false def } ifelse
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 26 def } ifelse
/AA where { pop } { /AA true def } ifelse

% --- the map (x east, z north) ------------------------------------------------
/MapOn where { pop } { /MapOn true def } ifelse
/MapSea where { pop } { /MapSea 0 def } ifelse
/MapRect where { pop } { /MapRect [ -1200 -1000 1200 1400 ] def } ifelse
/MapBackground where { pop } { /MapBackground [ -20 0 ] def } ifelse       % open sea
/MapFeatures where { pop } { /MapFeatures [
    [ /volcano 55 520  -560 60 ]                     % the island the camera stands on
    [ /volcano 75 300   420 1000 ]                   % across the strait
] def } ifelse
/MapPlanN where { pop } { /MapPlanN 240 def } ifelse

% --- the camera -----------------------------------------------------------------
% (#79) up the slope among the palms, looking north-east along the shore:
% the beach curving away, the lagoon inside the reef, the surf on the reef,
% and the second island across the strait
/StandAt where { pop } { /StandAt [ -334 -66 ] def } ifelse
/LookAt where { pop } { /LookAt [ -210 140 ] def } ifelse
/LookTilt where { pop } { /LookTilt -1.5 def } ifelse
/CamAbove where { pop } { /CamAbove 3 def } ifelse
/HFov where { pop } { /HFov 58 def } ifelse
/TMax where { pop } { /TMax 1600 def } ifelse
/SunAzim where { pop } { /SunAzim 150 def } ifelse    % high, behind the camera on the right
% meadow and beach texture at every distance (#103, lib/fc_midground.ps)
/MidGrass where { pop } { /MidGrass 1 def } ifelse
/MidSand where { pop } { /MidSand 1 def } ifelse
/MidBump where { pop } { /MidBump 1 def } ifelse
% (#118) the beach reads as sand at preview size: a high sun behind the camera
% puts pale sand on the tone curve's shoulder, where relief alone hardly
% changes the tone, so the sand is a little darker (below the shoulder) and
% the relief carries tone: swells and hummocks with darker troughs, wind
% ripples near the camera, the berm's crest with a darker, damper foreshore
% below it, and damp sand that stays dark at a glancing angle
/CoastSand where { pop } { /CoastSand [ 0.77 0.70 0.55 ] def } ifelse
% (#141) the beach's edge wanders in lobes across the slope, not one
% airbrushed gradient (more, or sharpened, reads as painted lawn patches)
/CoastRag where { pop } { /CoastRag 0.8 def } ifelse
% and the grass nearest it a little paler and drier, with tufts on the sand
% (a strong straw band, or a sharpened edge, reads as painted)
/CoastDune where { pop } { /CoastDune 0.5 def } ifelse
/MidSwell where { pop } { /MidSwell 0.6 def } ifelse
/MidSwellK where { pop } { /MidSwellK 1 def } ifelse
/MidRipple where { pop } { /MidRipple 0.3 def } ifelse
/MidRippleK where { pop } { /MidRippleK 0.2 def } ifelse
/MidBerm where { pop } { /MidBerm [ 12 3 0.5 0.2 ] def } ifelse
/MidDamp where { pop } { /MidDamp 6 def } ifelse
/MidDampGraze where { pop } { /MidDampGraze 0.5 def } ifelse
% the /Tropical preset's cumulus, with finer steps far off and the edge found by
% bisection, so the distant cumulus come out clean instead of speckled (#120;
% /Floor, as golden_coast has it, made them a third heavier here)
/CloudLayers where { pop } { /CloudLayers [
    << /Type /Cumulus /Lo 62 /Hi 92 /Threshold 0.56 /CoverAmp 0.6 /Scale 0.032 /Wind 20
       /StepGrow 0.003 /Refine 4 >>
] def } ifelse
Plan { /Erode where { pop } { /Erode false def } ifelse } if

(lib/fc_presets.ps) run
[ /Tropical ] fc-presets
(lib/fc_landscape.ps) run

Plan {
    320 200 fc-map-plan
    (C) TerrOX TerrOZ Yaw fc-map-plan-camera
} { 320 200 fc-landscape } ifelse
showpage
